@startuml package-diagram
title Wild-Life Eco Simulation — Package Dependency Diagram

skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Main\n(Entry/Controller)" as MAIN {
}

package "View\n(JavaFX rendering)" as VIEW {
    component Renderer
    component BasicRenderer
    component SpriteRenderer
    component Camera
}

package "Model\n(BioLogic)" as MODEL {
    component Entity
    component Plant
    component Animal
    component "Herbivore / Carnivore\n/ ApexEntity / WaterAnimal" as Animals
    component "Concrete species\n(Rabbit, Wolf, ...)" as Species
}

package "Strategy\n(behavior swap)" as STRATEGY {
    component SurvivalStrategy
    component "Passive / Scared / Hunter\nAggressive / Apex / Thirsty" as Strategies
}

package "World\n(map + tick loop)" as WORLD {
    component World
    component Terrain
    component Season
}

package "Event\n(Observer)" as EVENT {
    component EventBus
    component EventListener
    component EventType
    component AudioSystem
}

package "Stats" as STATS {
    component StatisticsCollector
}

' Dependencies (mũi tên: A phụ thuộc B)
MAIN --> VIEW
MAIN --> WORLD
MAIN --> MODEL
MAIN --> STATS
MAIN --> EVENT

VIEW --> MODEL  : reads entity state
VIEW --> WORLD  : reads grid + camera transform

MODEL --> STRATEGY  : delegates behavior
MODEL --> WORLD     : queries terrain + nearest water
MODEL --> EVENT     : publishes attack/eat/death

STRATEGY --> MODEL  : reads Animal state
STRATEGY --> WORLD  : scans entities + terrain

WORLD --> MODEL    : holds entities
WORLD --> EVENT    : publishes bird/leaves

STATS --> EVENT    : subscribes to events
STATS --> WORLD    : snapshots population
STATS --> MODEL    : counts per species

EVENT --> EVENT    : self-routing (subscribe/publish)

note bottom of MODEL
  KHÔNG import javafx.*
  → đảm bảo tách MVC
end note

note bottom of VIEW
  Chỉ tầng View phụ thuộc JavaFX
end note

@enduml
